              "RAM, dann Platte, sonst neu",
              "Schlüssel: nur die uploadId"
            ],
            "phase": 1,
            "note": [
              "Aufräumen inaktiver Sessions: upload.go:314-361, alle 5 min"
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "miss",
            "type": "proc",
